B.YW=new A.b_("2) Look at two static screens inside Mutant Research Lab. One is by Deadshot, other is behind Richtofen's test tube family.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.YX=new A.b_("3) Take the first letter of each word that flashes on the screens. The letter by Deadshot is ALWAYS first.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.YI=new A.b_("3) Select the two letters in the grid. Note that you may only get a single letter in your game.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.YO=new A.b_("4) If the letters can be reversed to get a second code, a 'Flip Letters' button will appear.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
